#. Key:	master-tab.painting-adapter-method.mesh-based-planar.tooltip
#. SourceLocation:	Plugins/Iliad/Source/Editor/OdysseyViewportDrawingEditor/Private/Widgets/SOdysseyViewportDrawingEditorMasterTab.cpp(261)
